    Lifecycle rules:
      - reasoning_content → start/continue "thinking" block
      - reasoning (no reasoning_content) → start/continue "text" block (flash-lite)
      - content → close thinking if open, start/continue text block
      - finish_reason → close current block, emit message_delta

